                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10049-10062-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <ul>
	<li>The central management system provides an interface for configuring replication settings for each database.</li>
	<li>Supported settings include consistency level (e.g., eventual consistency, strong consistency), conflict resolution strategy, and replication frequency.</li>
	<li>Changes to replication settings are applied dynamically without requiring system restarts.</li>
	<li>The system validates the configuration settings to prevent invalid configurations.</li>
</ul>

  </td>
            </tr>
