    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>As a system administrator, I want to configure replication settings (e.g., consistency level, conflict resolution strategy) through the central management system so that I can easily manage replication across the distributed database.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
